OL,3,GNEWSATrainee Metro driver takes on six
OL,4,Aendurance events
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer is taking on a
OL,7,Fseries of extreme physical challenges
OL,8,Fto raise cash for a mental health
OL,9,Fcharity he credits with saving his
OL,10,Flife.
OL,12,FJohn Loraine, now a trainee Metro
OL,13,Fdriver, enjoyed his previous job with
OL,14,Fthe Northumbria force but over the
OL,15,Fyears aspects of it impacted on him
OL,16,Fbadly.
OL,18,FHe was referred to Climbing Out, an
OL,19,Foutreach service supporting adults
OL,20,Ffollowing life-changing injuries or
OL,21,Ftrauma, which he said brought him "back
OL,22,Ffrom the brink".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
