OL,3,GNEWSATrainee Metro driver takes on six
OL,4,Aendurance events
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 37-year-old, from Gosforth,
OL,7,FNewcastle, is tackling six endurance
OL,8,Fevents to raise money for the charity,
OL,9,Fin many cases carrying a heavy weight
OL,10,Fon his back, to show "whatever weight
OL,11,Fwe carry we do not have to carry it
OL,12,Falone".
